## Test Anti-Pattern Audit: `ProductCatalogTests.cs`

### Summary

| Severity | Count |
|----------|-------|
| **Critical** | 2 (systemic — affecting all 10 tests) |
| **Medium** | 2 |
| **Low** | 1 |

This suite is a textbook **coverage-touching** class. All 10 public methods on `ProductCatalog` are called — inflating coverage to ~95% — but almost nothing is actually verified. Bugs in `UpdatePrice`, `ApplyBulkDiscount`, `ImportFromCsv`, `RemoveProduct`, and `Search` would sail past these tests undetected.

---

### Critical Findings

#### 1. Coverage-Touching Pattern (all 10 tests)

The class methodically calls every public member on `ProductCatalog` without asserting meaningful outcomes. This is the single most likely explanation for "95% coverage but production bugs."

| Test method | Line | Assertions | What it misses |
|---|---|---|---|
| `AddProduct_Works` | 17 | **None** | Never checks product was actually stored |
| `GetProduct_Works` | 23 | `IsNotNull` only | Never checks SKU, Name, or Price on the returned product |
| `UpdatePrice_Works` | 31 | **None** | Never checks price actually changed to 14.99 |
| `RemoveProduct_Works` | 38 | **None** | Never checks product is gone after removal |
| `SearchProducts_Works` | 45 | `IsNotNull` only | Never checks result count or content |
| `GetAllProducts_Works` | 54 | `IsNotNull` only | Never checks count or contents |
| `GetProductCount_Works` | 62 | **None** | Never checks count value |
| `ApplyBulkDiscount_Works` | 68 | **None** | Never checks prices were reduced |
| `ExportToCsv_Works` | 76 | `IsNotNull` only | Never checks CSV content |
| `ImportFromCsv_Works` | 84 | **None** | Never checks product was imported |

**6/10 tests have zero assertions. 4/10 assert only `IsNotNull`.**

**Fix** — each test should assert the *behavioral outcome*. Examples for the highest-risk methods:

```csharp
// UpdatePrice_Works → verify the price actually changed
[TestMethod]
public void UpdatePrice_UpdatesStoredPrice()
{
    _catalog.AddProduct(new Product("SKU-001", "Widget", 9.99m));
    _catalog.UpdatePrice("SKU-001", 14.99m);
    var updated = _catalog.GetProduct("SKU-001");
    Assert.AreEqual(14.99m, updated!.Price);
}

// RemoveProduct_Works → verify the product is gone
[TestMethod]
public void RemoveProduct_MakesProductUnretrievable()
{
    _catalog.AddProduct(new Product("SKU-001", "Widget", 9.99m));
    _catalog.RemoveProduct("SKU-001");
    Assert.IsNull(_catalog.GetProduct("SKU-001"));
}

// ApplyBulkDiscount_Works → verify prices were reduced
[TestMethod]
public void ApplyBulkDiscount_ReducesAllPricesByFraction()
{
    _catalog.AddProduct(new Product("SKU-001", "Widget", 10.00m));
